TITLE Albite kinetics in pH 2 at 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and H2S gas
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2 charge
    units mol/kgw
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5

KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 in 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -step true
    -totals Na Al Si S Fe
END
